# Google Maps Platform API Key (used by @vis.gl/react-google-maps and Next.js Route Handlers)
#
# Quickstart for Prototyping (Zero-Billing Maps Demo Key):
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card required)
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms
# 4. Click to generate / reveal your Maps Demo Key
# 5. Copy the key below into a local `.env.local` file (never commit `.env.local`)
#
# Required APIs for Production Google Cloud Keys:
# - Maps JavaScript API
# - Places API (New)
# - Routes API
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here

# Optional: separate server-only key for Route Handlers in production (falls back to NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY)
# GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_server_restricted_google_maps_api_key_here
